5. Perusal of initial decree dated 4.7.2008 reveals that the same was passed on the compromise deed Ex.PA. The terms of compromise were as under:-

"1. that the defendant would pay Rs.10000/- as monthly maintenance allowance to the plaintiff;

2. that until the defendant constructed his own house he would keep her in a separate abode;

3. that he would give her 8 tolas gold;

4. that the defendant would not subject the plaintiff to maltreatment and cruelty in which eventuality he would pay the damages amounting to Rs.100000/-;

5. that the plaintiff would live peacefully with the defendant and on his bidding. Further that she would not act contrary to his wishes.

In this behalf joint statement of the parties duly identified by each other was also recorded. Needless to say that the terms of the compromise will be binding on the parties"
